ind  a plate full of meat he enjoys the dish  prepared by Miss Eloise before  apologizing to her for being rude the  other day she forgives him and goes to  the kitchen to fetch Mark another plate  leaving the attic door open taking  advantage of the opportunity Mark  quickly takes out the Bell attached to  the door so that it doesn't make noise  when he tries to escape after he  finishes the food Miss Eloise brings out  some bones explaining that they can tell  one's future she claims that these bones  are telling her that on the day of the  blood moon Mark will get all the poison  out of his body and meet his family she  then instructs him to throw the bones on  the bed to learn more about his future  however he refuses to participate and  Miss Eloise comments that Mark is just  like her son Lewis before she got him  straight 8 after Miss Eloise leaves him  with the bones Mark becomes bored and  starts assembling them but to his horror  he realizes that it's a human hand  moreover it appears to be his son  Titan's hand as it too has a broken  middle finger because of the Revelation  a terrified Mark throws up everything he  consumed he then uses his lock picking  skills to unlock the door and sneak out  of the room with his injured feet Mark  drags himself downstairs but before he  can escape Miss Eloise's pet Crow alerts  her prompting him to hide she rushes to  the attic to check up on her prisoner  but by that time Mark has already  escaped to the house he runs into the  woods and comes across the debris of the  crashed plane inside he sees the blood  of his family but no dead bodies Mark  then notices a Hut nearby but before he  can investigate he collapses on the  ground from exhaustion the next day he  again wakes up and Miss Eloise's attic  and notices her leaving for the market  with Earl from the window Mark then  removes the dressing from his feet and  to his horror he finds a metal Spike  shoved there by missile Eloise to keep  him from healing and running away with  no other choice he summons all his  strength and courage to pull the nail  out he also tries his best to keep  himself from screaming so that no one  can sense his Escape after the painful  ordeal Mark again Ventures out and  notices three newly filled Graves  fearing they could belong to his wife  and children he frantically digs the  grave but it turns out that they're just  the graves of sacrificed animals  relieved Mark heads to the barn where he  finds a basement upon inspection he  comes across some of Miss Eloise's dark  magic books and desecrated dead bodies  he goes through her books and learns  that she is preparing him for the blood  moon day for the transference of Life  spell for this spell a person's life is  sacrificed to mend someone else's  injuries although Mark is terrified he  soon regains his composure and turns the  tables by using the magic books to make  a new Boogity doll for Miss Eloise  shortly after as he proceeds to return  back to the room he hears the sound of a  phone ringing and after some searching  eventually finds it Mark then takes the  phone back back to his room but forgets  to close the main door when Miss Eloise  returns she notices the door and  suspects that Mark has managed to get  out once again she immediately orders  Lewis to fetch the ax and rushes to the  attic Mark hears the approaching  footsteps so he reluctantly puts the  spike back in his foot which makes him  wail in pain after a while the Voodoo  Woman arrives fortunately after  inspecting his dressing she doesn't find  anything suspicious so she lets him be  after she leaves Mark calls 9-1-1 and a  local policeman picks it up surprisingly  the cop reveals that his family came to  the police station a week ago and  reported him and Titan missing Mark  controls his emotions and tells the  officer that he has been held hostage by  a certain Miss Eloise and Earl the  policeman recognizes the couple and  Promises to get there as soon as  possible a while later he arrives  Outside The Farmhouse and talks to miss  Eloise while Mark removes the spike from  his foot again unfortunately this only  enrages the woman so she storms into the  attic to punish Mark she grabs his  Boogity doll and slams him on the bed  after this she makes him lose his voice  and wraps a threat around to the Boogity  effectively tying the real mark up after  she leaves to meet the officer Mark hops  to the window but he is unable to utter  a word and alert the cop refusing to  give up Mark grabs the Boogity doll and  hops downstairs but by then the  policeman has already laughed despite  this he slowly follows the cop and  eventually catches up to him after  putting a thread in the boogity's mouth  Mark also gets his voice back he then  explains everything to the cop and asks  him to drive away but just when they  reach a bit further Mark realizes that  the cop is friends with the voodoo  couple and he has again taken him back  to the doomed house it's a blood moon  and Marcus then dragged into the barn  where the villagers have gathered to  witness his sacrifice viora simsara and  Titan are also brought into the barn  much to Mark's shock on one hand he is  relieved to see Titan and the rest of  his family alive but they are unusually  calm and quiet seemingly under Miss  Eloise's spell after the ceremony begins  Miss Eloise blows her magic dust on Mark  making him fall asleep he is then laid  on the table as the villagers cheer with  excitement Miss Eloise plans to replace  Earl's diseased heart with marks so she  proceeds to make an incision on his  chest with a dagger but suddenly Mark  wakes up takes out the spike from his  foot and stabs Earl right through the  heart much to everyone's horror he then  gets up from the table causing all the  people including Miss Eloise to run out  in fear it turns out Mark had earlier  replaced Miss Eloise's magic dust with  something else and therefore it didn't  work after the coast is clear Mark  